t alone while a pin's key includes the intent; ancestry is written without the commitment's selected inputs; a manifest presents a pin of a kind no judge yet gives). Each is being verified against the lane data and the notes and will go to its owner; lane data is not changed. Step 16, wiring the capabilities in production, waits on those. Test cost: the Git package's tests add about 1.9 s (real git as client and server for the one honest push test); the cut from 2.6 s came from building fixtures once; the rest is the package's own process use."}